  "rationales": {"U":"'easily edited' 是主观模糊表述，未定义谁是编辑者、何种操作算'easy'，缺乏用户角色和交互上下文，导致开发与测试人员无法共识理解；'simplified administrative screens' 未说明简化标准或界面形态，违反可理解性","A":"'easily edited' 和 'simplified' 均属价值判断型形容词，无客观判定基准；'administrative screens' 未明确是Web UI、CLI还是API端点，存在多重解释可能；'the web server where the game is hosted' 暗示单服务器部署模型，但未排除集群/容器化场景，引发架构歧义","C":"需求隐含'文件存储'为唯一持久化方式，但未确认是否符合安全合规要求（如GDPR日志留存、敏感信息加密）或系统约束（如无文件系统权限的无状态容器），正确性依赖未声明的假设","V":"无法设计可重复的测试用例验证'easy editing'或'simplified'——二者不可观测、不可度量；缺少具体触发条件（如'within 3 clicks'）、成功判据（如'editable by non-technical admin role'）及验证方法（如UI自动化脚本断言字段可编辑）"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"The game configuration data must be persisted to a UTF-8 encoded JSON file named 'game_config.json' in the /var/www/game/config/ directory on the primary application server.","A":"The game configuration data must be persisted to a UTF-8 encoded JSON file named 'game_config.json' in the /var/www/game/config/ directory on the primary application server. Administrators with the 'config-editor' role must be able to modify all top-level fields of this file via a browser-based HTML form at https://admin.example.com/config/edit, with no more than two form submissions required to persist any change.","C":"The game configuration data must be persisted to a UTF-8 encoded JSON file named 'game_config.json' in the /var/www/game/config/ directory on the primary application server. The file must be owned by the 'www-data' user, have permissions set to 640, and contain no plaintext credentials or PII.","V":"The game configuration data must be persisted to a UTF-8 encoded JSON file named 'game_config.json' in the /var/www/game/config/ directory on the primary application server. Administrators with the 'config-editor' role must be able to modify all top-level fields of this file via a browser-based HTML form at https://admin.example.com/config/edit, with each field editable in a single text input or select element, and changes persisted within 2 seconds of clicking the 'Save Configuration' button (verified by HTTP 200 response and filesystem mtime update)."},
